1
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:06,930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

2
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:06,930
Just like the cruel angel

3
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:14,590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

4
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:14,590
Young boy, become a legend

5
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:22,410
2D4U PRESENTS:

6
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,810
Aoi kaze ga ima

7
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,810
Even though the untested breeze...

8
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:29,510
mune no doa o tataitemo

9
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:29,510
...taps at the door to your heart

10
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:36,970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

11
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:36,970
You just look solely at me and smile

12
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:44,500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

13
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:44,500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

14
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

15
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

17
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

18
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,340
sono senaka ni wa

19
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,340
...that upon your back

20
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:02,960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

21
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:02,960
You have the wings with which to fly...

22
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:06,310
no hane ga aru koto

23
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:06,310
...towards the distant future

24
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:10,690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

25
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:10,690
The cruel angel's thesis

26
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:14,430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

27
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:14,430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

28
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:18,200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

29
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:18,200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

30
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,900
Omoide o uragiru nara

31
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,900
If you are to betray our memories

32
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

33
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

34
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:29,270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

35
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:29,270
Young boy, become a legend

36
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:38,950
Unit 01's interlocking circuits have been cut.

37
00:01:38,950 --> 00:01:40,450
What about the force eject signal?

38
00:01:40,450 --> 00:01:43,620
It's being blocked from the plug side.
It's not being accepted.

39
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:47,420
But, Shinji, if we hadn't done that,
you would have been killed.

40
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:48,790
That doesn't matter.

41
00:01:48,790 --> 00:01:50,790
But it is a fact.

42
00:01:50,790 --> 00:01:53,760
Don't make me more angry
by saying things like that.

43
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:56,550
Unit 01 has 185 seconds of power
left in its reserves.

44
00:01:56,550 --> 00:01:59,640
That's enough to destroy at least
half of Headquarters.

45
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,640
The way he is right now, he'll do it too.

46
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,680
Shinji, listen to us!

47
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:05,560
If Commander Ikari hadn't made that decision,

48
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:07,390
everyone could have been killed!

49
00:02:07,390 --> 00:02:09,940
I said that doesn't matter!

50
00:02:09,940 --> 00:02:11,110
My father...

51
00:02:11,110 --> 00:02:14,650
That bastard tried to kill Toji!

52
00:02:14,650 --> 00:02:15,900
With my hands...

53
00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:17,860
EPISODE 19
A MAN'S BATTLE

54
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:22,580
Father, you're there, aren't you?
Say something! Answer me!

55
00:02:22,580 --> 00:02:25,200
Increase the pressure of the LCL to maximum.

56
00:02:25,950 --> 00:02:28,370
We have no time to waste on a childish tantrum.

57
00:02:29,250 --> 00:02:31,380
I've still got a direct control circuit...

58
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:36,210
Damn! Damn!

59
00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:38,970
Damn...

60
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:42,390
The right breast has been completely dissolved.

61
00:02:42,390 --> 00:02:45,470
We'll begin cleansing the bodily fluids
from Unit 03 on schedule.

62
00:02:47,310 --> 00:02:48,390
Have you recovered?

63
00:02:48,390 --> 00:02:51,060
As long as I can work, it's not a problem.

64
00:02:51,060 --> 00:02:53,860
I couldn't just lie in bed during
an emergency like this.

65
00:02:56,110 --> 00:02:57,780
So what happened to Shinji?

66
00:02:57,780 --> 00:03:00,570
I understand that they opened the
escape hatch with a laser cutter,

67
00:03:00,570 --> 00:03:02,490
and removed him forcibly.

68
00:03:02,490 --> 00:03:04,330
That's just wonderful.

69
00:03:04,330 --> 00:03:04,990
This time...

70
00:03:04,990 --> 00:03:06,700
It might really be over.

71
00:03:07,250 --> 00:03:10,040
I'll bet that idiot won't recover from this.

72
00:03:10,580 --> 00:03:12,170
How is Ikari?

73
00:03:12,170 --> 00:03:15,380
He wasn't injured, so he ought to be okay.

74
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:17,210
He's probably dreaming away.

75
00:03:18,050 --> 00:03:18,840
Dreaming?

76
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:21,930
Yeah. Don't tell me you don't dream?

77
00:03:33,230 --> 00:03:34,650
Shinji...

78
00:03:35,230 --> 00:03:37,820
Why's he lyin' here next to me?

79
00:03:39,150 --> 00:03:41,450
Where am I?

80
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:43,740
In the same hospital as my sister?

81
00:04:00,010 --> 00:04:03,300
Hey, isn't that Shinji and Ayanami?

82
00:04:03,300 --> 00:04:06,220
Ikari, why did you do that?

83
00:04:06,220 --> 00:04:08,430
Because I couldn't forgive my father.

84
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:10,980
He betrayed me.

85
00:04:11,810 --> 00:04:14,850
I was finally able to have a comfortable
conversation with my father,

86
00:04:15,350 --> 00:04:19,110
but he won't try to understand my feelings at all!

87
00:04:19,110 --> 00:04:22,400
Did you try to understand your father's feelings?

88
00:04:22,650 --> 00:04:24,200
I tried.

89
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,870
Why don't you try to understand him?

90
00:04:25,870 --> 00:04:27,530
I said I tried!

91
00:04:27,530 --> 00:04:30,370
And that's how you run away
from unpleasantness.

92
00:04:30,370 --> 00:04:31,870
What's wrong with that?!

93
00:04:31,870 --> 00:04:35,000
What's wrong with running away
from unpleasantness?!

94
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:40,130
What are those two arguin' about?

95
00:04:42,550 --> 00:04:45,050
We're making a special exception for you.
Just for five minutes.

96
00:04:45,050 --> 00:04:46,970
I understand. Thank you very much.

97
00:04:53,850 --> 00:04:55,900
If it isn't the Class Rep...

98
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:57,980
Suzuhara, are you okay?

99
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:01,030
Well, looks like I'm still alive.

100
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:10,030
What the heck? I thought Shinji was here.
Was I just dreamin'?

101
00:05:10,030 --> 00:05:13,040
I heard Ikari was discharged yesterday.

102
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:15,330
You've slept for three days, Suzuhara.

103
00:05:16,170 --> 00:05:19,000
I did? For three whole days?

104
00:05:20,420 --> 00:05:22,130
Class Rep, did you...

105
00:05:22,130 --> 00:05:25,380
I came here as part of my duties
as the class representative!

106
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:27,390
There isn't anything else to it!

107
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:30,810
Yeah, I know that.

108
00:05:30,810 --> 00:05:32,390
You don't know anything.

109
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:36,890
Sorry that I didn't get to eat
the lunch you made.

110
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:39,810
Don't worry about it.

111
00:05:40,230 --> 00:05:44,740
But I'm sorry. They won't let me
bring you lunch here.

112
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:48,030
Class Rep?

113
00:05:48,030 --> 00:05:48,990
What?

114
00:05:48,990 --> 00:05:51,280
Would you do me a favor?

115
00:05:52,450 --> 00:05:56,500
Would you tell my sister that there's
nothin' wrong with me?

116
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:03,590
Get out, Shinji Ikari.
The Commander wants to see you.

117
00:06:05,340 --> 00:06:08,680
Disobeying orders, private
appropriation of an Eva,

118
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,510
blatant intimidation...

119
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:12,720
These are all criminal offenses.

120
00:06:13,390 --> 00:06:15,470
Do you have anything to say?

121
00:06:16,430 --> 00:06:20,270
Yes, I don't want to pilot an Eva anymore.

122
00:06:20,270 --> 00:06:22,320
I don't want to stay here either.

123
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,900
Then leave.

124
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:27,360
Yes. I'll go back to my teacher's place.

125
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,870
So you're running away again?

126
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:35,410
You disappoint me.
I doubt we'll ever meet again.

127
00:06:35,410 --> 00:06:37,410
Yes, that's my intent.

128
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:48,220
It's me.

129
00:06:48,220 --> 00:06:50,380
Erase the Third Child.

130
00:06:50,380 --> 00:06:53,720
Rei will be Unit 01's designated pilot,

131
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:55,720
with the dummy plug as backup.

132
00:07:28,170 --> 00:07:29,720
Are you there, Shinji?

133
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,760
Is it true that you're leaving?

134
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,510
It's true, isn't it?

135
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:37,640
But why? Why are you running away now?

136
00:07:39,180 --> 00:07:41,770
I wanted to be like you.

137
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:45,400
I envied you. You're different from us.

138
00:07:46,270 --> 00:07:50,700
Damn! Even Toji became an Eva pilot, while I...

139
00:07:52,490 --> 00:07:54,620
This line is monitored.

140
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:57,620
For security reasons, we have
terminated this call.

141
00:07:57,620 --> 00:07:59,410
We appreciate your cooperation.

142
00:08:03,580 --> 00:08:06,040
I'm sure that Asuka is so disgusted with me,
she's not coming.

143
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:09,090
Yes, she didn't even ask me
to say goodbye to you.

144
00:08:09,090 --> 00:08:11,920
That sounds like her. I'm relieved.

145
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:15,510
If you keep cutting your ties like this,
you'll have a tough life ahead of you.

146
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:19,140
That's your philosophy, Miss Misato.
I can't live like you.

147
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:21,180
As I'm sure you know,

148
00:08:21,180 --> 00:08:24,850
there will be quite a few restrictions
placed on your activities.

149
00:08:25,350 --> 00:08:27,020
Yes.

150
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,440
But...

151
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:29,480
What?

152
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,280
Please tell me one thing.

153
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:34,360
Why was Toji chosen to be the Fourth Child?

154
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:38,870
All the fourth-level candidates
were in your class.

155
00:08:39,370 --> 00:08:44,080
I just found out myself recently
that it was all set up.

156
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:45,620
All of them?

157
00:08:45,620 --> 00:08:47,000
All of my classmates...

158
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:51,260
What happened with Suzuhara was a mistake
that can't be mended with words alone.

159
00:08:51,670 --> 00:08:54,180
But, Shinji, to be honest,

160
00:08:54,180 --> 00:08:58,350
I was projecting all of my dreams,
hopes and purpose onto you.

161
00:08:58,350 --> 00:09:01,270
I also know that it's been a huge burden for you.

162
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:03,850
But we, everyone at Nerv,

163
00:09:03,850 --> 00:09:06,100
had no choice except to entrust
our future to you.

164
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:09,020
I want you to remember that one thing.

165
00:09:09,020 --> 00:09:10,940
That's a selfish excuse, isn't it?

166
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:13,070
I know it is.

167
00:09:13,070 --> 00:09:16,990
I'll leave your pass code to HQ
and your room as they are.

168
00:09:16,990 --> 00:09:19,580
There's no point. Get rid of them, please.

169
00:09:20,330 --> 00:09:22,750
I won't pilot an Eva again.

170
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:26,420
He's speaking aggressively.

171
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,210
I've never heard him like that.

172
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:42,470
Government Only Special Express R-13
Departing 13:38 to New Atsugi

173
00:09:37,930 --> 00:09:42,970
A special state of emergency has been declared
for the Tokai region.

174
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:44,100
Evacuation Route

175
00:09:42,970 --> 00:09:47,350
All residents, please evacuate to your
designated shelters immediately.

176
00:09:47,350 --> 00:09:48,730
Repeating...

177
00:09:48,730 --> 00:09:49,400
An Angel!

178
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:56,950
All personnel, battle stations, Level One.

179
00:09:56,950 --> 00:09:58,820
Prepare for ground-to-air intercept.

180
00:09:58,820 --> 00:09:59,780
Target status?

181
00:09:59,780 --> 00:10:01,410
It's currently advancing.

182
00:10:01,410 --> 00:10:03,160
The Komagatake Defense Line
has been penetrated.

183
00:10:12,130 --> 00:10:14,760
Armor layers one through eighteen
have been breached!

184
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:17,220
Eighteen layers of special armor at once?!

185
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:20,890
The Eva won't make it there in time
for a ground level intercept.

186
00:10:20,890 --> 00:10:22,810
Position Unit 02 for combat
inside the Geo-Front,

187
00:10:22,810 --> 00:10:24,270
directly in front of Headquarters.

188
00:10:26,180 --> 00:10:30,350
Asuka will engage the target as soon
as it breaches the Geo-Front.

189
00:10:30,350 --> 00:10:31,690
What about Unit 00?

190
00:10:31,690 --> 00:10:34,320
It's been placed in the AT Field
Neutralization Zone.

191
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,360
However, the left arm hasn't been
regenerated yet.

192
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,700
Then it can't engage in combat.

193
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:39,200
Sortie Rei in Unit 01.

194
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:42,620
Prepare a dummy plug as the backup system.

195
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:43,120
Yes, Sir.

196
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,580
Start entry.

197
00:10:45,580 --> 00:10:46,910
LCL electrolyzed.

198
00:10:46,910 --> 00:10:48,830
Commence A10 nerve connection.

199
00:10:53,420 --> 00:10:55,460
So it's not going to work anymore.

200
00:10:55,460 --> 00:10:56,550
Pulse flow is reversing!

201
00:10:56,550 --> 00:10:59,340
Unit 01 is rejecting the neural connections!

202
00:10:59,340 --> 00:11:01,180
No, that can't be possible!

203
00:11:01,180 --> 00:11:02,340
Ikari?

204
00:11:02,340 --> 00:11:04,930
Yes, it's rejecting me.

205
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:10,980
Abort activation. Sortie Rei in Unit 00.

206
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:13,190
Re-activate Unit 01 with the dummy plug.

207
00:11:13,190 --> 00:11:14,480
But Unit 00 isn't...

208
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,480
It doesn't matter. I'll go.

209
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,530
Rei?

210
00:11:17,530 --> 00:11:19,610
Even if I die, I can be replaced.

211
00:11:23,490 --> 00:11:27,240
I... I decided I'd never pilot it again.

212
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:30,500
Hey, you! What're you doing?
Get into the shelter, quickly.

213
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:31,960
It's no use!

214
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:34,840
One more hit, and all the armor layers
will have been breached!

215
00:11:35,290 --> 00:11:37,090
I'm counting on you, Asuka.

216
00:11:40,930 --> 00:11:42,430
Here it comes.

217
00:11:42,430 --> 00:11:46,430
Even if Shinji isn't here, I can do this by myself.
Piece of cake!

218
00:11:53,230 --> 00:11:54,650
Bastard!

219
00:12:00,690 --> 00:12:01,950
Darn. Next!

220
00:12:06,530 --> 00:12:09,120
I'm neutralizing its AT Field, aren't I?

221
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:12,580
Why won't it go down?!

222
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:18,840
I can't lose ever again!

223
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:27,300
No way!

224
00:12:38,190 --> 00:12:41,150
You damn bastard!

225
00:12:41,150 --> 00:12:42,240
Asuka!

226
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,950
Cut all the nerve connections now!

227
00:12:49,490 --> 00:12:52,830
Evacuation training? What are you, stupid?

228
00:12:52,830 --> 00:12:55,830
That stuff's got nothing to do with us pilots.

229
00:13:02,300 --> 00:13:03,920
Direct hit on the Eighth District!

230
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:08,180
Abandon the Sixth Shelter! All survivors,
hurry to the Third Shelter!

231
00:13:08,180 --> 00:13:10,180
Unit 02 is severely damaged!
It can't continue combat.

232
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:11,060
How's Asuka?

233
00:13:11,060 --> 00:13:12,600
She's safe. Alive!

234
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:16,520
Damn...

235
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:18,480
The Angel has started moving.

236
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:19,650
What's Unit 01's status?

237
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:23,030
Dummy plug upload, complete.

238
00:13:23,030 --> 00:13:24,700
Probe insertion, complete.

239
00:13:24,700 --> 00:13:26,240
Start contact.

240
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:27,490
Roger!

241
00:13:27,490 --> 00:13:28,620
What?

242
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:31,040
The pulses have vanished.
It's rejecting the dummy plug.

243
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:33,580
It's no use! Eva Unit 01 won't activate!

244
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:36,830
The dummy, Rei...

245
00:13:36,830 --> 00:13:38,830
It won't accept them?

246
00:13:38,830 --> 00:13:40,540
Fuyutsuki...

247
00:13:40,540 --> 00:13:42,210
I'm leaving you in charge for a bit.

248
00:13:42,210 --> 00:13:46,430
Number two and number four will be blocked off.

249
00:13:42,210 --> 00:13:46,430
Please evacuate immediately.

250
00:13:42,710 --> 00:13:44,210
Take casualties to the Sixth Block.

251
00:13:44,210 --> 00:13:46,680
Hurry the uninjured to the Third Shelter!

252
00:13:47,930 --> 00:13:48,800
This way!

253
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:49,430
Hurry!

254
00:13:49,470 --> 00:13:50,390
Quickly!

255
00:13:50,390 --> 00:13:51,220
Hurry!

256
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:53,890
Hey, you! What're you doing?
Do you want to die?!

257
00:13:55,350 --> 00:13:56,690
Asuka...

258
00:13:57,390 --> 00:13:58,940
Well, if it isn't Shinji.

259
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:01,190
Mr. Kaji?

260
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:04,690
What are you doing here?

261
00:14:04,740 --> 00:14:06,700
That's my line.

262
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:08,450
What are you doing here, Shinji?

263
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:10,990
I...

264
00:14:10,990 --> 00:14:13,330
I'm never going to pilot an Eva again.

265
00:14:13,910 --> 00:14:15,450
And since I decided that...

266
00:14:16,250 --> 00:14:18,080
I see.

267
00:14:18,210 --> 00:14:22,670
Well, since my moonlighting came out into
the open, I'm not welcome on the combat roster.

268
00:14:22,670 --> 00:14:24,670
So, here I am, watering the plants.

269
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:26,260
At a time like this?

270
00:14:26,260 --> 00:14:27,760
It's because it's a time like this.

271
00:14:28,180 --> 00:14:30,590
Between Katsuragi's breasts is nice too,

272
00:14:30,590 --> 00:14:33,100
but in the end, I want to be here when I die.

273
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:34,100
Die?

274
00:14:37,850 --> 00:14:39,140
That's right.

275
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:41,940
It's said if an Angel makes contact
with Adam, who lies below here,

276
00:14:41,940 --> 00:14:45,940
humanity will be eradicated in the Third Impact.

277
00:14:45,940 --> 00:14:47,360
The only thing that can stop it

278
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:50,450
is the one thing with power equal
to an Angel's, the Evangelion.

279
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:54,540
Ayanami?

280
00:14:54,540 --> 00:14:55,660
Without even a rifle?!

281
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,080
Does she mean to blow herself up?!

282
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:00,540
Rei!

283
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:06,300
AT Field, full power.

284
00:15:20,140 --> 00:15:21,060
What happened to Unit 00?

285
00:15:25,020 --> 00:15:25,520
Rei!

286
00:15:26,820 --> 00:15:27,860
What has she done?

287
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:33,820
Shinji, the only thing I can do
is stand here and water.

288
00:15:34,620 --> 00:15:38,580
But you, you have something that you can do.
That only you can do.

289
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:42,080
Nobody is forcing you.

290
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:44,460
Think for yourself, and make
the decision by yourself.

291
00:15:44,460 --> 00:15:46,590
Think about what you ought to do now.

292
00:15:47,460 --> 00:15:50,130
You know, so you don't have any regrets.

293
00:16:05,310 --> 00:16:07,400
Direct hit on the third foundation.

294
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:09,360
The final armor plate has melted!

295
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:12,200
Damn! The Main Shaft is completely exposed!

296
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:13,860
Isn't Unit 01 ready yet?

297
00:16:13,860 --> 00:16:15,450
It's rejecting the dummy plug.

298
00:16:16,030 --> 00:16:18,120
It failed! No response detected!

299
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:21,460
Keep trying. Repeat the process from step 108.

300
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:22,920
Let me pilot it!

301
00:16:23,460 --> 00:16:25,540
I... I...

302
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:28,960
Let me pilot Unit 01, please!

303
00:16:31,050 --> 00:16:32,130
Father...

304
00:16:35,050 --> 00:16:36,800
Why are you here?

305
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:45,480
I... I...

306
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:47,770
I am the pilot of Evangelion Unit 01!

307
00:16:47,770 --> 00:16:49,860
Shinji Ikari!

308
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:54,780
The target has invaded the Main Shaft!

309
00:16:54,780 --> 00:16:56,200
It's descending!

310
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:57,160
Where is it heading?

311
00:16:57,160 --> 00:16:59,580
It's advancing directly towards Central Dogma.

312
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:00,790
It's coming here.

313
00:17:00,790 --> 00:17:02,330
All personnel evacuate. Hurry!

314
00:17:02,330 --> 00:17:05,000
All personnel evacuate!
Repeat, all personnel evacuate!

315
00:17:18,350 --> 00:17:19,350
Eva Unit 01?!

316
00:17:20,260 --> 00:17:21,060
Shinji!

317
00:17:45,540 --> 00:17:46,370
Miss Misato!

318
00:17:46,370 --> 00:17:47,960
Launch number five! Hurry!

319
00:18:16,070 --> 00:18:18,070
Out of energy?

320
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:19,780
Unit 01 has reached its activation limit.

321
00:18:19,780 --> 00:18:21,070
The backup isn't working either!

322
00:18:21,070 --> 00:18:21,780
Shinji!

323
00:18:30,420 --> 00:18:31,170
Shinji!

324
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:35,630
Move! Move! Move! Move! Come on, move!

325
00:18:35,630 --> 00:18:37,760
There isn't any point to this
if you don't move now!

326
00:18:50,810 --> 00:18:51,690
That's...

327
00:19:04,910 --> 00:19:07,080
Move! Move! Move!

328
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:10,870
Move! Move! Move! Move! Move! Move!

329
00:19:10,870 --> 00:19:13,880
Move! Move! Come on, move!

330
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:17,550
If you don't move now, if you don't do it now,
everyone's going to die!

331
00:19:17,550 --> 00:19:20,590
I don't want any more of that! So...

332
00:19:20,590 --> 00:19:21,680
PLEASE MOVE!

333
00:19:47,540 --> 00:19:49,330
Eva has re-activated!

334
00:19:58,960 --> 00:20:00,630
Incredible!

335
00:20:00,630 --> 00:20:06,510
No way, this is unbelievable.
Unit 01's synch rate is over 400%!

336
00:20:06,510 --> 00:20:09,100
Does that mean she's really awakened?

337
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:53,600
It's eating the Angel?

338
00:20:58,650 --> 00:21:03,820
Eva Unit 01 is taking the S2 engine into herself?

339
00:21:24,550 --> 00:21:25,930
The bindings!

340
00:21:25,930 --> 00:21:27,140
Bindings?

341
00:21:27,140 --> 00:21:30,060
That's right. That's not armor plating.

342
00:21:30,060 --> 00:21:34,020
Those are restraints that allow us
to suppress the Eva's true power.

343
00:21:34,020 --> 00:21:37,400
And now those bindings are being undone
by the Eva's own might.

344
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:40,520
We can no longer stop the Eva.

345
00:21:41,190 --> 00:21:43,990
Unit 01's been awakened and set free.

346
00:21:43,990 --> 00:21:46,280
Seele won't stay quiet for this.

347
00:21:46,280 --> 00:21:49,070
Was this also part of your script,
Commander Ikari?

348
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:51,790
It's begun, hasn't it?

349
00:21:51,790 --> 00:21:54,450
Yes, it all begins here.

350
00:21:57,870 --> 00:22:00,380
TO BE CONTINUED

351
00:23:05,900 --> 00:23:06,860
PREVIEW

352
00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:09,030
Mankind has been saved
by the Eva's awakening,

353
00:23:09,030 --> 00:23:12,570
but Shinji is taken into Unit 01
and merges with it physically.

354
00:23:12,570 --> 00:23:16,540
They try to salvage him, but fail.
What was it that the crying Misato saw?

355
00:23:16,540 --> 00:23:19,330
Next time: "Form of the Mind,
Form of the Man"

356
00:23:17,700 --> 00:23:20,920
FORM OF THE MIND, FORM OF THE MAN
